capability deque/insert-remove  an item put at or taken from a place inside
  heroes  containers.deque_insert, containers.deque_remove_at
  go      ring.Link, ring.Unlink
  rust    VecDeque::insert, VecDeque::insert_mut, VecDeque::remove, VecDeque::swap_remove_back, VecDeque::swap_remove_front
  python  deque.insert, deque.__delitem__, deque.remove
  note    each moves the items on the nearer side, at most half; Rust's swap removes are `deque_get` of the end, `deque_put` over the place and a pop. Go's `Link` and `Unlink` splice links of two rings, which is items put in or taken out at a place here. Python's `remove` by value is `lists.index_of` over `deque_to_list`, then this

